+### Requirement: Merchant review moderation is product-scoped
+Merchant update and delete endpoints MUST operate only on the review identified by the URL and belonging to the URL product. A missing review or a review belonging to another product MUST return HTTP 404.
+
+#### Scenario: Merchant updates a review
+- **WHEN** a merchant updates an existing review for its product
+- **THEN** its rating and/or description are changed
+- **AND** the product aggregate is recalculated
